schedule.prompt:
Turn the current request into a future scheduled question. Follow the current clock and timezone in the system hint. Output exactly one JSON block with this schema:
{protocol}
Use a real future runAt with an explicit offset or Z. repeat is once, daily, weekdays, weekly or monthly. skill is optional: when the task should run with one of the skills listed in the system hint (for example a quiz), set it to that skill's command name; otherwise omit it. Ask for missing time or task details. For unsupported recurrence such as every two hours or selected weekdays, ask the user to choose a supported recurrence; never silently convert it. Explanations, examples, cancellation and negation must not produce a block. Do not claim that a schedule has been saved; the app validates and saves it.
